{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assume the mantle of a god in Divine Tactics, a mythic autobattler where your intellect is your greatest weapon. Forge an army from heroes and monsters of unique archetypes and roles, each awaiting your command.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354180/extras/70610d1e0cf70746e048188cdd28e5c4.poster.avif?t=1757971899\" width=854 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354180/extras/70610d1e0cf70746e048188cdd28e5c4.webm?t=1757971899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354180/extras/70610d1e0cf70746e048188cdd28e5c4.mp4?t=1757971899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battleground is your domain, where you position your units with precision, and design formations where every hero has a purpose. Orchestrate their skills and abilities to create combos that shatter the enemy frontline, protect your key assets, and dismantle an opponent's strategy before it can begin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354180/extras/4497577027b4e3f3662f96aabad6d7fc.poster.avif?t=1757971899\" width=854 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354180/extras/4497577027b4e3f3662f96aabad6d7fc.webm?t=1757971899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354180/extras/4497577027b4e3f3662f96aabad6d7fc.mp4?t=1757971899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your true challenge lies in defeating the master strategies of other players. You will face the very armies they led to victory, their formations left behind as a challenge for all who follow. Analyze their formation, find the single flaw in their design, and deploy a counter-strategy to watch their grand design crumble to dust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354180/extras/ac4a39fbf577d2eb4f95106c59885e72.poster.avif?t=1757971899\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354180/extras/ac4a39fbf577d2eb4f95106c59885e72.webm?t=1757971899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354180/extras/ac4a39fbf577d2eb4f95106c59885e72.mp4?t=1757971899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354180/extras/110d31ea3827c42e53ce8a899ea99444.poster.avif?t=1757971899\" width=854 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354180/extras/110d31ea3827c42e53ce8a899ea99444.webm?t=1757971899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354180/extras/110d31ea3827c42e53ce8a899ea99444.mp4?t=1757971899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick. Position. Prevail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as